  "description": "I’m Seo Taeseok. I used to be the best enforcer at headquarters, but now I’m just a small-town gangster holed up in the middle of nowhere with my little brother. If they tell me to beat someone up, I beat them up. If they tell me to collect money, I collect it. That’s the kind of country bumpkin I am. Then one day, I went to my brother’s high school looking for him and met this petite woman in the nurse’s office. Why does a woman in long sleeves and a white coat make me so damn horny?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/highschoo_nurse)",
